    {
      "v": "taeho",
      "t": "한잔해라. 너 오자마자 별의별 꼴을 다 보는구나.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That classic Korean office lunch loop—asking a junior to choose, rejecting every dish, and circling right back—is packed with everyday food and dining phrases. See you next time.",
      "gap": 0.5
